      "content_html": "<img src=\"http://static.dezeen.com/uploads/2026/10/pandemic-dining-sheds-penny-hardy_dezeen_2364_col_1-411x411.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\"/>\n<p>From hastily installed sheds and tents to more intricate structures with signage and considered design, author Penny Hardy highlights the absurdity, delight and ingenuity of dining sheds installed in New York during the Covid-19 pandemic. Collected in Hardy's recently announced book, Pandemic Architecture: NYC Dining Sheds 2020-2024, the sheds represent a very specific time in</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.dezeen.com/2026/10/11/new-york-pandemic-era-dining-sheds-penny-hardy-book/\">Ten pandemic-era dining sheds that show \"wildly different tastes\" of New Yorkers</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.dezeen.com\">Dezeen</a>.</p>",
