    {
      "id": "https://www.dezeen.com/2026/10/10/brewery-cultural-centre-brno-acronym-collective-studio/",
      "url": "https://www.dezeen.com/2026/10/10/brewery-cultural-centre-brno-acronym-collective-studio/",
      "title": "[Dezeen] Acronym Collective Studio transforms former brewery in Czech Republic into community centre",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"http://static.dezeen.com/uploads/2026/10/brewery-cultural-centre-acronym-collective-studio_dezeen_2364_col_0-411x411.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\"/>\n<p>Architecture firm Acronym Collective Studio has transformed a former brewery near Brno into a community centre, which addresses its corner site with a curved, perforated brick facade. Named Kulturní Centrum Pivovar or Brewery Cultural Centre, the building in the town of Velká Bíteš contains a library, information centre, family centre, multi-purpose community hall and creative</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.dezeen.com/2026/10/10/brewery-cultural-centre-brno-acronym-collective-studio/\">Acronym Collective Studio transforms former brewery in Czech Republic into community centre</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.dezeen.com\">Dezeen</a>.</p>",
