      "title": "[Dezeen] Didea creates steel-clad streetwear store inside ZHA's Mercury Tower",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"http://static.dezeen.com/uploads/2026/10/super-f-didea-malta_dezeen_2364_col_sq1-411x411.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\"/>\n<p>Architecture studio Didea designed the interior of the Super F streetwear store in St Julian's, Malta, as a flexible, modular grid to avoid invasive architectural alterations inside the Mercury Tower by ZHA. The store exterior has a glazed, curved facade that welcomes visitors from the outside and is partly echoed inside the store with a</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.dezeen.com/2026/10/07/didea-super-f-streetwear-store-mercury-tower-malta/\">Didea creates steel-clad streetwear store inside ZHA's Mercury Tower</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.dezeen.com\">Dezeen</a>.</p>",
